<title>UK: Shire gets rights to Uripas from Recordati.</title>
<headline>Shire gets rights to Uripas from Recordati.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britian's Shire Pharmaceuticals Group Plc said on Friday that it secured exclusive rights to distribute Uripas from Italian pharmaceutical group Recordati.  </p>
<p>Shire will have the right to distribute Uripas, which is for the relief of urinary urgency and incontinence, in the UK, Ireland, South Africa, Thailand and 11 other territories.</p>
<p>Uripas has UK sales of one million stg in a total UK market of 17 million for such products.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
